~ start
Danilo: [color=#808080](Which bus should I take?)[/color]
Danilo: [color=#808080](I need to find the bus to Santa Claridad.)[/color]
=> END

~ Bus_1
Danilo: [color=#808080](Montelargo... This isn’t the bus I’m supposed to take.)[/color]
do set_bus_used("bus_1")
=> END

