~ Bus_4
Danilo: [color=#808080](Santa Claridad... Found it at last.)[/color]
Danilo: [color=#808080](Now, I just need to buy a ticket.)[/color]
do set_bus_used("bus_4")
do ObjectiveManager.complete_objective(2)
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(3, "Buy a ticket")
=> END

